  "display_title": "The Secretly Capable Child Is Looking For Her Dad",
  "description": "Jongno-Gu. One day when I was four, my father's death notice arrived. My father, who claimed to come from an empire called Talochium and was the strongest paladin, left me behind.\n\n *\"If you wish, I'll send you back. To where you were born. To where you should have been. To where that man still lives.\"*\n\nThe last chance offered by the mysterious lifeform that appeared from my father's keepsake box. Now I can save him, right? But... \n\nThe father from the past I finally reunited with seems a little off somehow. \n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
